WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.201 --> 00:00:01.496
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.528 --> 00:00:07.474
- [Voiceover] You probably
think huskies are a breed

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.751
of dog but you're wrong,

00:00:08.751 --> 00:00:10.806
they're actually the greatest
college basketball teams

00:00:10.806 --> 00:00:11.546
in the world.

00:00:11.546 --> 00:00:13.114
- [Voiceover] Mystic doens't
mean having the quality

00:00:13.114 --> 00:00:16.376
of magic, it means an
awesome aquarium in Seaport.

00:00:16.376 --> 00:00:18.466
- [Voiceover] 95's not
a number close to 100,

00:00:18.466 --> 00:00:20.635
it's the worst place to be
stuck in rush hour traffic

00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:22.042
behind Massholes.

00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:24.291
Lake Compounce isn't a
boring body of water.

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:27.007
It's the name of the nations
oldest continuously operating

00:00:27.007 --> 00:00:27.959
amusement park.

00:00:27.959 --> 00:00:29.562
- [Voiceover] Dunks has
nothing to do with basketball.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.280
It's where you go for bomb-ass coffee.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.731
- [Voiceover] The sound
is not a type of noise,

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:36.713
it's a beautiful estuary that
covers 1,320 square miles.

00:00:36.713 --> 00:00:38.768
- [Voiceover] Whalers are not
the people who hunt whales.

00:00:38.768 --> 00:00:40.823
They are the ledgendary ice
hockey team that left Hartford

00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:43.703
in 1997 but who will
hopefully return someday soon.

00:00:43.703 --> 00:00:44.840
- [Voiceover] Most people
think Connecticut is

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.733
just a small state in the northesat

00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:49.351
but it's actually the
best place to grow up.

